"Comic panel, aspect 5:4 (987×804 px). Draw the image only: no text, no speech balloons, no captions, no panel border.
Art style (identical in every panel of this comic): hand-drawn 2D European comic art in the ligne claire tradition, clean uniform black ink outlines, flat colours without gradients, simple cel shadows, detailed readable backgrounds, consistent character proportions.
Location: garage, polvere sospesa, sera.
Framing: medium shot, waist up; low angle looking up, imposing; 35mm lens.
Characters: alex (lead, head and torso, expression: teso).
Composition: subject centered.
Action: Alex spinge la porta del garage e si ferma
Props: porta basculante, auto coperta da un telo.
Lighting: backlit, rim light.
Mood (composition and staging, not a subject; colours stay those of the art style): tense: tight framing, strong diagonals, stiff poses.
Continuity: giacca strappata al gomito sinistro dalla pagina precedente
Keep the top center area free of important detail (x 22–52%, y 15–26%): a speech balloon goes there.
Avoid: text, lettering, speech balloons, captions, watermark, signature, panel borders."
